{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U6RkIZFfOwWXOFumlCsEsg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:45.527800+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U6RkIZFfOwWXOFumlCsEsg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>为进一步加强优秀大学生对我院的全面了解</span></span><span><span>，促进全国高校优秀大学生之间的相互交流，搭建师生交流平台，我院将于7月开展2026年优秀大学生校园开放日活动，具体安排如下：</span></span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、学院简介 </span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>武汉大学资源与环境科学学院是一个集理、工、管理于一体多学科交叉的综合性学院。学院涵盖地理学、环境科学与工程、测绘科学与技术、公共管理四个一级学科。在教育部第四轮学科评估中分别获评A-、B+、A+、A等级。学院共建两个国家“双一流”学科，两个二级学科地图学与地理信息系统、地图制图学与地理信息工程被评为国家级重点学科，地理学、环境科学与工程、土地资源管理为省级重点学科。</span></span></p><section><span>学院师资力量雄厚，现有在职教职工140余人，其中教授/研究员40余人，两院院士2人，欧亚科学院院士1人，国家教学名师2人，享受政府特殊津贴专家12人，</span><span>各类高层次人才20余人</span><span>，形成了良好的人才梯队。</span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>二、</span><strong><span><span>组织管理 </span></span></strong></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>本次活动由学院研究生招生工作领导小组统筹实施，负责整体方案制定、组织协调及监督落实，确保活动规范、有序、高效开展。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>三、</span><strong><span><span>报名方式与要求 </span></span></strong></span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>（一）报名条件</span></span></span></p><section><span>1.国内高水平大学、全国重点大学具有相关专业背景的优秀在校生（2027年应届本科毕业生）。</span></section><section><span>2.学习成绩优异。</span></section><section><span>3.对所报专业领域的科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，有较强的科研潜力；外语水平良好；身心健康。</span></section><section><span><span>（二）报名流程</span></span></section><section><span>1.报名时间：2026年7月2日-7月6日</span></section><section><span>2.报名方式</span></section><section><span>申请者须于2026年7月6日前完成在线报名，报名通道：</span></section><section><span>https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DZWxkcEREUXhaTVFF</span></section><section><span><span>（三）申请材料</span></span></section><section><span>1.个人简历；</span></section><section><span>2.身份证正反面扫描件、学生证扫描件；</span></section><section><span>3.本科阶段成绩单，须加盖所在学校或院系教务部门红章；</span></section><section><span>4.成绩排名证明，须加盖所在学校或院系教务部门红章；</span></section><section><span>5.外语水平证明：国家英语四、六级考试成绩或TOEFL、GRE、GMAT、IELTS成绩等；</span></section><section><span>6.体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、专利、出版物或原创性成果，各类获奖竞赛证书等证明。</span></section><section><span>特别提示：请将申请材料按照以上顺序扫描合并成一个PDF文件，命名格式为“申请专业-姓名”，于报名结束前通过报名通道提交。</span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、活动安排</span><strong><span><span> </span></span></strong></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>活动时间：2026年7月10-12日。具体安排另行通知。</span></span></p><section><span>活动地点：武汉大学资源与环境科学学院</span></section><section><span>活动内容：学院情况介绍、学科方向宣讲、科研团队展示及师生互动交流</span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>五、其他事项</span><strong><span><span> </span></span></strong></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学院将对报名材料进行审核，初审通过的学生将获得活动参与资格，有关信息将通过邮件或电话告知，请各位同学保持电子邮箱和手机通讯畅通。未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p><section><span>本次活动参与学生往返交通及食宿费用自理。凡后续被我院录取为2027级研究生者，入学后可报销本次活动差旅费用（限本科就读高校所在地为武汉市外的学生），具体报销标准及流程入学后另行通知。学院为现场活动参与者统一购买活动期间意外伤害险。</span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>六、</span><strong><span><span>联系方式 </span></span></strong></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>联系电话：027-68778676（工作时间开通）</span></p><section><span>联系邮箱：yangmiaoling@whu.edu.cn</span></section></section></section></section><p><span>武汉大学资源与环境科学学院</span></p><p><span>2026年7月2日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>编排 | 马宁</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>审核 | 吕来</span></span></p></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"3495b84b6390d28b005c5f15fbb494062b3d2439b1efae063a81b1d10d145f4e","textLength":1260,"sourceSha256":"86577f737cadb6a75e089496c7e3dcce544f72026f15f39b286fc1920709cd34","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-bddceb7cbe15179e5644","title":"2026年武汉大学资源与环境科学学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生校园开放日活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:45.527800+00:00"}
